Why we are using 4 tables

We are deliberately not creating dozens of tables.

The separation is:

lines → What lines exist and where they are.

line_units → Which DL/FT units belong to each line.

unit_current_state → What is happening right now.

monitoring_events → What happened historically.

That structure fits your 60-line monitoring requirement well.

Before we go further

Do not create the FastAPI or frontend yet.

First run the database script in SQL Server 2014 and confirm that these four tables are created successfully.

Then our next Phase 1 step will be insert 2–3 sample lines + DL/FT data and test the relationships and queries.